		{"id":"ee6936dacfbe1c75","type":"text","text":"Finds an underground group of assassins willing to try the developed [[Serums]], said group becomes extremely successful","x":-5880,"y":2901,"width":357,"height":180},
		{"id":"983b3d59181767c2","type":"text","text":"Government catches onto the underground group, realizes the former lead researcher is essentially in charge of the group","x":-5480,"y":2913,"width":340,"height":207},
		{"id":"90a2fe46c61484f1","type":"text","text":"Signs deal with [[International Government]], formally making the [[Chromatic Organization]] a much bigger entity","x":-5100,"y":2913,"width":367,"height":155},
		{"id":"23d542904c23821b","type":"text","text":"[[Chromatic Station|Chromatic Stations]] develop over time, operations turn international","x":-4680,"y":2913,"width":280,"height":155},
		{"id":"961bc6b631edfa94","type":"text","text":"Begins researching vision with leads to [[Chroma]] independently","x":-7800,"y":3121,"width":320,"height":119},
		{"id":"9835fe6359df51a4","type":"text","text":"Promoted to Head of a Biotech Division","x":-7400,"y":2945,"width":260,"height":93},
		{"id":"05bff72a59844ac1","type":"text","text":"Discovers the 6 forms of Chroma","x":-7040,"y":2945,"width":250,"height":93},
		{"id":"b560fbf7be5bb570","type":"text","text":"Finds out/suspects that the Chroma is seen by other division team members","x":-6720,"y":2922,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"7945ed644b7bd3f9","type":"text","text":"Kills his division, steals own replicable copies of confidential research, destroys lab and traces of new research, goes on the run","x":-6340,"y":2900,"width":395,"height":180},
		{"id":"a0e51edf8debbcd2","type":"text","text":"Joins [[International Government]] Research Team","x":-8140,"y":2920,"width":254,"height":140},
		{"id":"9d18d8019638de7d","type":"text","text":"[[Lead Researcher]]","x":-8500,"y":2960,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"24e12bfb8eab3513","type":"text","text":"Jess and Dev meet again in a brief fight, then reunite","x":4340,"y":-3420,"width":300,"height":140},
		{"id":"349a14ceaccbe119","type":"text","text":"Meet up multiple times in the following months in secret to catch up with each other","x":4680,"y":-3420,"width":360,"height":140},
		{"id":"9f70f958deaaeee0","type":"text","text":"Jess becomes a Chromatic","x":3420,"y":-3560,"width":320,"height":70},
		{"id":"a4653fa75c3bfef5","type":"text","text":"Dev becomes a Chromatic for another shot at staying alive without the mafia knowing where he is, alongside the chance to take down the mafia once and for all now that he's a more capable fighter","x":2780,"y":-3480,"width":480,"height":210},
		{"id":"d780b7686d0d477e","type":"text","text":"Dev is on the run from both the mafia and law enforcement for killing multiple mafia members","x":2060,"y":-3440,"width":460,"height":140},
		{"id":"685876d07f8e6884","type":"text","text":"After Dev keeps getting into encounters that end up killing more mafia members, the mafia decides to blow up Dev's house (though Dev was away on some vacation while that happened) which makes Dev perpetually paranoid for his own safety ","x":1320,"y":-3460,"width":580,"height":200},
		{"id":"3d41a32004a36de8","type":"text","text":"Mafia ends up targeting Dev for killing some of the gang members that targeted his bf, and the mafia starts tracking Dev down","x":800,"y":-3460,"width":440,"height":178},
		{"id":"425adbd24713428d","type":"text","text":"Dev leaves work, encountering a group of mafia members that are in the middle beating up his boyfriend, then fends them off even as it's too late to save said boyfriend","x":160,"y":-3460,"width":452,"height":220},
		{"id":"3e73c87780536709","type":"text","text":"Bullies and brings terror to a multitude of civilians she personally knows as a result of her inner personality roaming essentially free (no specific decided events yet)","x":-380,"y":-3760,"width":613,"height":140},
