		{"id":"98f12d79633eed56","type":"text","text":"Cyn gets in trouble with Ex after Raine runs from the scene since she was the only one  was responsible for stealing/trashing house, Cyn and ex break up","x":160,"y":-2420,"width":460,"height":140},
		{"id":"a8cd5a28cbc1c53e","type":"text","text":"Ex asks Raine to go steal the stuff back, claiming that it was his, not knowing she was the one who stole it from him","x":180,"y":-2200,"width":389,"height":180},
		{"id":"54dd94a5cc9f7d59","type":"text","text":"Raine and Ex steal the stuff together successfully, leading into longer-term partnership of breaking/entering and stealing from people for underground contracts","x":640,"y":-2200,"width":480,"height":180},
