		{"id":"40779c8abfa80425","type":"text","text":"Cyn and Raine bump into eachother at ex's house on the night Raine decides to steal the coworker's belongings back, Raine blackmails Cyn to avoid getting in direct trouble with the firm","x":-940,"y":-2307,"width":500,"height":200},
		{"id":"92fae1acf8e608b0","type":"text","text":"Ex starts searching for Raine, find out she's reported as dead and blames Chromatics org for killing her, starts targeting and harming Chromatics org","x":2940,"y":-2600,"width":412,"height":220},
